#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Plot Estimator results {#plot-estimator-results}"
msgstr "Plot keputusan Estimator {#plot-estimator-results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit does not have a built-in function for plotting Estimator results, but"
" you can use Matplotlib's [`bar` "
"plot](https://matplotlib.org/stable/api/_as_gen/matplotlib.pyplot.bar.html) "
"for a quick visualization.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit tidak mempunyai fungsi terbina untuk memplot keputusan Estimator, "
"tetapi anda boleh menggunakan plot "
"[`bar`](https://matplotlib.org/stable/api/_as_gen/matplotlib.pyplot.bar.html)"
" Matplotlib untuk visualisasi pantas.\n"

